Spec: Project/Indexes

Purpose:
  Category-level index list for fast resolution of project knowledge.

Indexes:
  module
  domain
  feature
  api
  database
  dependency
  test
  deployment

Rules:
  Indexes are routing metadata.
  Indexes MUST NOT become the source of truth.
  Indexes MUST reference authoritative SDD files, not duplicate them.

Note:
  This file differs from map.sdd: map.sdd answers "where should I go?"
   with concrete Resolution (@modules, @domains); this file is a broader,
   category-level index declaration (for future search by categories
   like `api`, `database`, `test`, `deployment`). To prevent duplication
   (see architecture/architecture.sdd -> NoDuplication) this file does
   not store concrete path lists, it only declares which categories are
   indexed — concrete index content will be added when corresponding
   domains/modules are rebuilt.


State: +

